OL,3,GLondon & South East                    
OL,5,CToday:FA cloudy start to the weekend,  
OL,6,Fwith outbreaks of rain over Hampshire  
OL,7,Finitially. The rain quickly spreads to 
OL,8,Faffect all areas. A breezy day, with   
OL,9,Fstrong winds along the coast.          
OL,11,CTonight:FRain and cloud clear from the 
OL,12,Fwest during the second half of the     
OL,13,Fnight. Prolonged clears spells to      
OL,14,Ffollow, with light winds allowing for  
OL,15,Fsome fog patches to form.              
OL,17,CSunday:FBright and sunny for most,     
OL,18,Fperhaps a little cloudier along the    
OL,19,Fsouth coast where light showers may    
OL,20,Fdevelop by the afternoon. Light winds  
OL,21,Finland, but breezier along the coast.  
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
